# Copy to hf.env (gitignored) and fill in a real value.
# Backs the hf-creds k8s Secret, consumed by whisper-worker as HF_TOKEN.
#
# NCAIR1/Igbo-ASR, NCAIR1/Yoruba-ASR, and NCAIR1/Hausa-ASR are gated repos on
# Hugging Face -- anonymous download gets a 401 GatedRepoError even though
# the repo page is publicly visible. Create a token at
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens (read access is enough) on an
# account that has requested and been granted access to all three model
# pages, then paste it here. transformers' pipeline()/from_pretrained() picks
# up HF_TOKEN automatically -- no code change needed beyond wiring the env
# var through.
hf_token=changeme
